================================================================================
SCOPE: THIS LICENCE COVERS THIS PROJECT'S CODE ONLY
================================================================================

The MIT terms above apply to the source code, scripts, tests, configuration and
documentation authored in this repository. They do NOT apply to any dataset.

NO DATASET IS REDISTRIBUTED HERE. `data/` is excluded from version control in
full, and a test (`tests/test_phase5.py::test_no_dataset_files_are_tracked_by_git`)
fails the suite if a dataset file is ever staged. Figures rendered from dataset
imagery are likewise excluded (`reports/figures/` is gitignored) and are
regenerable from `scripts/`.

Each of the ten data sources this project used remains under its own terms, and
those terms were verified from each provider's landing page or access form on
2026-09-12. NONE of the ten ships a licence file. In summary:

  * CC BY 4.0 (4 sources) - CP-AnemiC; Ghana conjunctiva (Mendeley nt7r8hv2pz);
    Ghana fingernails (Mendeley 2xx4j3kjg2); the four-wavelength Hb-PPG dataset.

  * CUSTOM NON-COMMERCIAL AGREEMENT, REDISTRIBUTION FORBIDDEN (2 sources) -
    SBVPI and MOBIUS (University of Ljubljana). Both require a signed Data Access
    and Processing Agreement obtained directly from the provider, permit
    non-commercial research use only, and mandate specific acknowledgements and
    citations. MOBIUS alone permits scaled-down or watermarked figures; SBVPI
    makes no such allowance.

  * NO LICENCE STATED AT ALL (2 sources) - the NUS 8-camera colour constancy
    benchmark and Eyes-Defy-Anemia. Used under the customary research-use
    expectation their pages imply, with the citations their authors request.
    Their redistribution terms are UNVERIFIED because none are published.

  * PUBLIC RESEARCH RESOURCES (2 sources) - the OMLC/Prahl and mcxyz spectralLIB
    optical constants, and the Jiang et al. camspec camera spectral sensitivities.

Obtaining any dataset is the user's responsibility and is subject to that
provider's terms, not to this licence. Per-source URLs, licence status and
obtaining instructions are in `reports/dataset_manifest.md`; the full licence
audit is in `reports/phase1_dataset_licences.md`.

NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE. This software is a research artefact. It is not a
diagnostic device, it has never been clinically validated, and all of its
evaluation is retrospective on public datasets.
